<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="AMO" style="id">Amos</book>
  <para style="h">Amos</para>
  <para style="toc1">Amos</para>
  <para style="toc2">Amos</para>
  <para style="mt">Amos</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Juda lal Uzia lal lai leh Israel lal Joasa fapa Jeroboama lal laiin, lîrnghîn hma kum hnihah khânin, Tekoa-ah ran rual vêngtute zînga mi Amosa thu, Israel chungchâng a hmuh chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “ Lalpa chu Zion tlâng aṭangin a rûm hum hum ang a, Jerusalem khua aṭangin a aw a chhuah ang a; berâm vêngtute ran tlatna hmunte chu an lungngai ang a, Karmel tlâng chhîp chu a vuai ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpan heti hian a ti: “Damaska khaw bawhchhiatna pathum avângin, a ni, pali avângin, a hremna chu ka tireh lo vang; Gilead ram chu buh râwtna thîrte chuan an râwt avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nimahsela, Hazaela inah mei ka tîr ang a, Benhadada lal inte a kâng zo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Damaska khaw kawngkhâr thîr chu ka titliak ang a, Aven ruam ata a luahtute leh Eden in ata lal tiang kengtu chu ka tibo vang a; tin, Suria ram mite chu Kir ramah salah an awm ang,” Lalpan a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Gaza khaw bawhchhiatna pathum avângin, a ni, pali avângin, a hremna chu ka tireh lo vang; Edom hnêna pêk tûrin mi zawng zawng sala an hruai avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nimahsela, Gaza khaw kulh chungah mei ka tîr ang a, a lal inte chu a kâng zo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Asdod khua ata a luahtu leh Askelon khua ata lal tiang kengtu ka tiboral ang a; tin, Ekron khaw chungah ka kut ka lek ang a; tin, Philistia mi la awmte chu an boral ang,” Lalpa Pathian chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpan heti hian a ti: “Tura khaw bawhchhiatna pathum avângin, a ni, pali avângin, a hremna chu ka tireh lo vang; Edom hnênah mi zawng zawng chu an pêka, inunauna thu an thlun chu an hriat reng loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nimahsela, Tura khaw kulh chungah mei ka tîr ang a, a lal inte chu a kâng zo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpan heti hian a ti: “Edom bawhchhiatna pathum avângin, a ni, pali avângin, a hremna chu ka tireh lo vang; a unau chu khandaihin a ûma, a khawngaihna zawng zawng a paih bova, a thinurna chuan a pawh thlêr fo ṭhina, kumkhuain a thinrimna chu a vawn reng avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nimahsela, Teman hmun chungah mei ka tîr ang a, Bozra khaw lal inte chu a kâng zo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpan heti hian a ti: “Amon fate bawhchhiatna pathum avângin, a ni, pali avângin, a hremna chu ka tireh lo vang; an ram an tihzau theih nân Gilead khaw hmeichhe nau paite an tai thlêr avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nimahsela, Raba khaw kulh chungah mei ka chhêm alh ang a; tin, indo nia au nên, ṭhâwngaleivir nia thlipui nên, a lal inte chu a kâng zo vang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />an lal chu salah an man ang a, a mi liante nên a rualin,” Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpan heti hian a ti: “Moab bawhchhiatna pathum avângin, a ni, pali avângin, a hremna chu ka tireh lo vang; Edom lal ruhte chu chinai ang hiala a hâl avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nimahsela, Moab chungah mei ka tîr ang a, Kerioth khaw lal inte a kâng zo vang a; tin, Moab chu buai leh au leh tawtawrâwt riin a thi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chumi zîng ata rorêltu chu ka tibo vang a, a mi liante zawng zawng chu, amah nên ka that ang,” Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Juda bawhchhiatna pathum avângin, a ni, pali avângin, a hremna chu ka tireh lo vang; Lalpa dân chu an hnara, a thupêkte an vawn lohva, an pate biak ṭhin pathian lemte khân a hruai bo avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nimahsela, Juda chungah mei ka tîr ang a, Jerusalem khaw lal inte chu a kâng zo vang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Israel bawhchhiatna pathum avângin, a ni, pali avângin, a hremna chu ka tireh lo vang; tangkaruaa mi fel an hralh avâng leh pheikhawk bun khata tlachham an hralh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi retheite lû chunga vaivut takngial pawh an ît a, pachhiate an rûksak a, pa leh a fapa chuan nula pakhat an zen ṭâwm a, ka hming thianghlim an tibawlhhlawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Maichâm awmna apiangah puan dahkham chungah an mu ṭhîn a, an pathian inah chuan mi an chawitîr mante chuan uain an in ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nimahsela, anmahni hmaah Amor-ho, sidar thing anga sâng leh sasua anga chak pawh kha ka tiboral a; a chung lam ata a rah leh a hnuai lam ata a zung pawh ka tibo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Amor-ho ram nei tûrin Aigupta ram aṭangin ka hruai chhuak che u a, thlalêrah kum sawmli chhûngin ka hruai che u a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, zâwlnei ni tûrin in fapate zînga mi leh, Nazarit te ni tûrin in tlangvâlte zînga mi ka siam a. Aw, Israel fate u, chutiangin a ni lo vem ni?” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Nimahsela, Nazarit mite hnênah uain in tûr in pe a, zâwlneite hnênah, ‘Thu hril suh u,’ tiin thu in pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ngai teh u, buhphala khat tawlailîr chilh angin in hmunah ka nem ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, mi tlân chakte chakna a bo vang a, mi chakin tha a so thei hek lo vang a, mi chak tak pawh a inhum thei lo vang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />thal ngul hmangtu pawh a ding thei hek lo vang a, kal chak thei mi pawh a inhum thei lo vang a, sakawr chung chuang mi pawh a inhum thei hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan mi thiltithei tak zînga mi huaisen pawh chu saruakin a tlân bo vang,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw, Israel fate u, Aigupta ram aṭanga ka hruai chhuah chhûngkuate u, Lalpan hetia a sawisêlna che u thu hi ngaithla rawh u:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Nangni chauh hi khawvêla chhûngkua zawng zawnga ka hriat in ni a; chuvângin, in khawlohna zawng zawngahte chuan ka hrem ang che u,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An inrem chauh loh chuan mi pahnih an kal dûn ang em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sakeibakneiin ngawah sa a man lai loh chuan a rûm ngai em ni? Sakeibaknei vânglaiin eng mah a man loh chuan, a pûk ata a rûm ang em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A tân chah a awm loh chuan, sava chu lei chunga thangah a âwk thei em ni? Thang chu eng mah âwk lovin lei aṭangin a per ang em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khawpuiah mi hlauh lohvin tawtawrâwt an hâm ang em ni? Lalpan a tirh loh chuan khawpuiah chhiatna a lo awm ang em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Dik takin Lalpa Pathian chuan a rawngbâwltu, a zâwlneite hnênah a thurûk hrilh lovin eng mah a ti lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sakeibaknei a rûm a, tuin nge hlau lo vang? Lalpa Pathian chuan thu a sawi a, tuin nge hril lo thei ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Asdod khaw lal inahte leh Aigupta ram lal inahte chuan hril ulangin, ‘Samari tlâng chungahte inkhâwm ulangin; tin, chuta buaina lian tak awmte leh chumi zînga hnehchhiahna awmte chu en rawh u,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pâwngnêk leh tharum thawha an chhuhsakte chu an lal inahte an chhêk khâwm a, dik taka tih an tum hauh lo,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa Pathian chuan, “An hmêlmaten an ram chu an rawn hual ang a, an kulhte an tichim ang a, an lal inte pawh an tichhia ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti a: “Berâmpuin sakeibaknei kâ ata a berâm ke pahnih emaw, beng them emaw a chhan chhuak angin, chutiangin Samari khuaa khum kilah leh, khum maimaw puan phan lukham chunga Israel fa awmte chu an chhan chhuak ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Engkimtithei Pathian, Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak chuan heti hian a ti: “Ngaithla ula, Jakoba chhûngte hriattîr rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />An bawhchhiatna avânga Israel ka hrem ni chuan, Bethel khuaa maichâmte ka tichim ang a, a kîte a tliak vek ang a, leiah a tla ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, thlasik in leh nipui in ka vaw chhia ang a; saingho inte chu a boral ang a, in ropui zawng zawng pawh tihchhiat a ni ang.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nangni Samari tlânga chêng nuho, Basan sebâwng châwm thau angte u, retheite hnehchhiaha, tlachhamte nêka, pasalte hnêna, “Rawn la ula, i in ang u,” titute u, he thu hi hre rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan ama thianghlimna chhâlin chhia a chham a: “Ngai teh u, thîr kawmin a lâk bo che ua, in zînga awm chhun nghakuaiin a lâk bo che u ni a lo thleng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, bang pawpahte in kal chhuak ang a, mi tin ngîl takin an kal ang; Harmon hmunah in inpaih ang,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Bethel-ah chuan lo kal ula, bawhchhe rawh u; Gilgal-ah chuan lo kal ula, bawhchhiatna tipung rawh u; tin, in inthawinate chu tûk tin rawn la ula, in sâwma pakhatte chu ni thum dan zêlah rawn la rawh u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tin, dawidim telh lâwmthu hrilh inthawina chu hlân ula, mahni duh zâwnga hlannate chu hril ula, puang rawh u; aw Israel fate u, hei hi in duh zâwng tak a ni si,” Lalpa Pathian chuan a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Tin, kei pawhin in khawpui zawng zawngahte ṭâmna leh in hmun zawng zawngahte tlâkchhamna ka pe che u a; chuti pawhin ka hnênah in lo kîr lo va,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Tin, buh lâk hun tûr thla thum a la nih laiin in chunga ruah sûr tûr pawh ka chelh a. Khawpui pakhat chunga ka sûrtîrin, khawpui dang chungah ka sûrtîr lo va. Hmun khat chungah a sûr ṭhîn a, a sûr lohna hmun chu a ro ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutichuan, khawpui pahnih emaw, pathum emaw chu khawpui pakhatah tui in tûrin an vâk a, an khawp lo va; chuti pawhin ka hnênah in lo kîr lo,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Rona leh hmuarnain ka hrem che u a: in huante, in grêp huante, in theipui kûngte, in olive thingte zozai chu thingngêt pangang chuan a ei zo vek tawh a ni a; chuti pawhin ka hnênah in lo kîr lo,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Aigupta ram angin in zîngah hripui ka tîr a; khandaihin in tlangvâlte chu ka that tawh a, in sakawrte ka hruai bo tawh a ni; tin, in sipai hmun rimchhia chu in hnâra nam khawpin ka awmtîr a; chuti pawhin ka hnênah in lo kîr lo,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Sodom leh Gomorra khua chu Pathianin a tihchim lai angin, in zîngah mi ṭhenkhat ka tichim a, thing kâng ul lâk chhuah ang in ni a; chuti pawhin ka hnênah in lo kîr lo,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Chuvângin, aw Israel, i chungah hetiang hian ka ti ang: i chungah hei hi ka tih dâwn avângin, aw Israel, i Pathian tâwk tûrin inpeih rawh.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ngai teh, tlângte din chhuaka, thli siama, mihring hnênah chuan a ngaihtuahna eng nge ni tih sawi chhuahsaka, zîng chu ti thima, lei hmun sângte chîltu chu a hming Lalpa , Sipaihote Pathian chu a ni si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw, Israel chite u, he thu nangmahni sûn nâna ka sawi hi hre rawh u:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />nula thianghlim Israel chu a tlu tawh a; a ding leh tawh lo vang. A ram chungah paih thlâk a ni tawh a ni; amah tungding tûrin tu mah an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti si a: “Israel chite hnênah chuan, khawpui, sâng chhuahna khân za a hnutchhiah ang a, khawpui, za chhuahna khân sâwm a hnutchhiah ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Israel chite hnênah chuan heti hian a ti si a, “Mi zawng ula, in nung ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />nimahsela, Bethel khua zawng suh ula, Gilgal-ah lût hek suh ula, Beersheba khuaah kai suh u; Gilgal khua chu mathei lovin salah an man dâwn si a, Bethel khua chu a lothlâwn ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa chu zawng ula, in nung ang; chuti lo chuan, Josefa inah mei angin a chhuak ang a, a kâng zo vang a, Bethel khuaah timit tûr tu mah an awm lo vang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />rorêlna sai thinga chantîra, felna chu leia paih thlate u!”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Siruk leh chhohreivûng siamtu leh, thihna daihlim zînga chantîrtu leh chhûn chu zân thima siamtu, tuifinriat tuite kova, lei chunga luantîrtu chu, amah chu zawng ulangin; a hming chu Lalpa a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />kulh chungah boralna lo thleng khawpa mi chakte chunga boralna thlentu chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kulh kawngkaa dik taka rorêltu chu an hua a, thu dik tak sawitu chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chuvângin, mi retheite rap betin buh in lâk luihsak a, lung chher chuan inte in sa a; nimahsela, a chhûngah in chêng lo vang; grêp huan nuamte in siam a; nimahsela, a uain in in lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />In bawhchhiatnate tamzia leh in sualnate nasatzia ka hre si a; mi felte tiduhdaha, thamna laa, kulh kawngkaa tlachhamte chanpual ngei pawh pe phal lote u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutichuan, mi fing chu chutiang hunah chuan a ngawi reng a, hun ṭha lo a nih avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />In nun theih nân ṭhat lohna zawng lovin, ṭhatna zawng ula; tin, in sawi angin Lalpa , Sipaihote Pathian chu in hnênah a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sualna chu hua ula, ṭhatna ngaina ula, kawngkaah rorêlna chu tungding nghet rawh u. Josef-ho mi la awm chhunte chungah chuan Lalpa , Sipaihote Pathian chuan khawngaihna a nei dah law maw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa , Sipaihote Pathian, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Kawtlai zau zawng zawngah ṭah vak vakna a awm ang a; kawtthlêr zawng zawngah, ‘A va pawi êm!’ an ti ang a; lungngai tûrin lo neitute leh ṭap vak vak tûrin sûn thiamte an ko vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, grêp huan zawng zawngah an ṭap vak vak ang, in zîngah ka kal tlang dâwn si a,” Lalpan a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa ni duhte u, in chung a pik e! Engati nge Lalpa ni chu in duh? Eng ni lovin thim a ni zâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sakeibaknei kalsana savawm tâwk mi ang leh, ina lûta, bang chunga kut nghata, rûlin a chuk ang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lalpa ni chu êng ni lovin thim a ni dâwn lo vem ni? Thim chhah leh êng rêng rêng pawh nei lovin?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“In kûtte ka huain ka hmusit a, in inkhâwmpui urhsûnahte chuan ka lâwm hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A ni, in hâlral thilhlan leh in buh hlan mi hlân mah ula ka pawm lo vang a, in ran thau remhlante pawh ka ngaihsak hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />I ṭingṭang ri mawi chu ka ngaithla lo vang; chuvângin, ka lakah i hla bengchheng chu la bo rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nimahsela, rorêlna dik chu lui angin luang sela, felna chu luipui kang ngai lo angin luang rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aw, Israela chhûnghote u, kum sawmli chhûngin thlalêrah khân inthawinate leh thilhlante ka hnênah in rawn la em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A ni, in lalber Sikkuth leh in Kaiuan milimte, in arsi pathian, mahni tâna in siam chu, in la ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chutichuan, Damaska khaw piah lamah salah ka kaltîr ang che u,” Sipaihote Lalpa Pathian chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zion tlânga nuam lutuka awmte leh, Samari tlânga him taka awmte leh hnam lian ber mi ropuite, an hnêna Israela chhûngho an kalnate chung chu a pik e!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kalneh khuaah kal ula, en rawh u; tin, chuta ṭangin Hamath khaw ropuiah chuan kal ula; tin, Philistia ram Gath khuaah chuan kal chhuk ula. Hêng ramte ai hian an ṭha zâwk em? In ram aiin an ram a zau zâwk em?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nangni ni ṭha lo hla taka dah leh nunrâwng ṭhutna hnaihtîrte u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />saingho khuma mua, an ṭhutthlêngsei chungahte zi mara, berâm rual zînga berâmnote leh sebâwng awmna zîng ata sebâwngtuaite eia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />ṭingṭanga dâwngdahna hlate saa, Davida anga mahni tâna hla thlûk hmanruate siama,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />berhbu liana uain ina, hriak ṭha bera inhnawihte chu; nimahsela, Josef-ho hrehawmna avângin an lungngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutichuan, tûna sala kal hmasate nên salah an kal ang a, zi marte hlim bûng bûngna chu a bo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa , Sipaihote Pathian chuan, Lalpa Pathian chuan amah leh amah inchhâlin chhia a chham a: “Jakoba chapona chu ka ten a, a lal inte ka hua a; chuvângin, khua leh a chhûnga awm zawng zawngte chu ka mantîr dâwn a ni.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a lo ni ang a, in pakhatah mi sâwm an la awm chuan an thi ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, mi pakhat pami a hâltu ngei pawhin a la a, in chhûng ata a ruh la chhuak tûrin, in chhûngnung bera awm hnênah, “I hnênah tu pawh an la awm em?” a tiha, anin, “Awm lo,” a tih chuan, anin, “Ngawi tlat rawh; Lalpa hming chu kan lam tûr a ni si lo va,” a ti ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ngai teh u, Lalpa chuan thu a pe si a; tin, in lian chu a chim rem rum ang a, in tê pawh chu a khi chat rel rul ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sakawrte chu lungpui chungah an tlân ang em ni? Chutah miin sebâwngin lei an let ang em ni? Nangnin rorêlna chu thihna hlovah leh felna chu sai thinga in chantîr hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />nangni thil thlâwn chunga lâwma, “Keimahni chaknain a ni lâwm ni kîte kan lâk?” tite u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“En teh u, aw Israela chhûngte u, nangmahni do tûrin hnam ka din chhuahtîr ang a; tin, Hamath khaw kawtchhuah aṭangin Araba lui thlengin an tiduhdah ang che u,” Lalpa , Sipaihote Pathian thuchhuak chuan a ti si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan inlârna mi hmuhtîr a. Chutah chuan khaukhuap rual tam tak a siamte chu ka hmu a. Hei hi lal chanpual buh an chhûn hnua buh ṭiah leh ṭan tirh lai takin a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a lo ni a, chumi rama hlobet chu an ei zawh hnuin, “Aw Lalpa Pathian, ngaidam rawh, ka ngên a che! Jakoba chu engtin nge a din theih ang? Amah a tê si a,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />He thûah hian Lalpa chu a inlamlêt a: Lalpa chuan, “Chu chu a thleng lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa chuan inlârna mi hmuhtîr leh a, a mite hrem nân mei a ko lai ka hmu a; mei chuan tui thûk tak chu a kâng vek a, ram pawh a kâng dâwn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, keiin, “Aw Lalpa Pathian, bâng rawh, ka ngên a che. Jakoba chu engtin nge a din theih ang? Amah a tê si a,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />He thûah hian Lalpa chu a inlamlêt a: Lalpa chuan, “Hêngte pawh hi a lo thleng lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hetiangin mi entîr leh a; chutah chuan, Lalpa chu bang ngîl taka rem kianga a ding ka hmu a, a kutah enremna a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, ka hnênah Lalpa chuan, “Amosa, eng nge i hmuh?” a ti a. Tin, keiin, “Enremna,” ka ti a. Tin, Lalpa chuan, “Ngai teh, ka mi Israel-te zîngah enremna ka dah ang a; anmahni ka pêl leh tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Isaaka hmun sângte chu a ram ang a, Israel hmun thianghlimte chu tihchhiat a ni ang; tin, Jeroboama chhûngte chu khandaihin ka do vang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Bethel khaw puithiam Amazia chuan Israel lal Jeroboama hnênah, “Amosa chuan Israela chhûngte zîngah a phiar che a. Ram chuan a thu zawng zawng chu a tuar thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amosa chuan heti hian a ti si a, ‘Jeroboama chu khandaihin a thi ang a, mathei lovin a ram aṭangin Israel chu salah a hruai chhuak ang,’” tiin thu a thawn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Amosa hnênah Amazia chuan, “Aw, nang zâwlnei, kal la, Judai ramah tlân bo la, chutah chuan chaw ei la, thu hril rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nimahsela, Bethel khuaah thu hril leh tawh suh; lal hmun thianghlim leh lal in a nih avângin,” a ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Amazia hnênah Amosa chuan, “Zâwlnei ka ni lo va, zâwlnei fapa pawh ka ni hek lo; ran rual vêngtu leh theipui thing enkawltu ka ni zâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan berâm rual vênna ata chu mi la a, Lalpa chuan ka hnênah, ‘Kal la, ka mi Israel-te hnênah thu hril rawh,’ min ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutichuan, tûnah Lalpa thu chu hre rawh. ‘Nangin Israel kalhin thu hril suh la, Isaaka chhûngte kalhin i thu thlah suh la,’ i ti a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />chuvângin, Lalpa chuan heti hian, ‘I nupui chu khawpuiah nawhchizuar a ni ang a, i fapate, i fanute chu khandaihin an tlu ang, i ram chu tehna hruiin an sem ang a; tin, nangmah ngei chu ram thiang lo chhûngah chuan i thi ang a, mathei lovin Israel chu a ram ata salah an hruai bo vang,’ a ti a ni,” tiin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan inlârna mi hmuhtîr leh a, nipui thei bâwm ka hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, anin, “Amosa, eng nge i hmuh?” a ti a. Keiin, “Nipui thei bâwm,” ka ti a. Tin, Lalpa chuan ka hnênah, “Ka mi Israel-te tâwpna tûr a ṭuah ta, ka hêl tawh lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak chuan, “Chumi nîah chuan biak in hlate chu lusûn hlaah a chang ang; mitthi ruang a tam ang a, hmun tinah ngawi rengin an paih chhuak ang,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hei hi ngaithla rawh u, aw tlachhamte ei zo duha, ram mi rethei tibo duhte u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Buh kan zawrh theih nân thla thar chu eng tikah nge a ral ang a, chhangphut buh kan hralh theih nân Chawlhni chu eng tikah nge a ral ang?” titu, epha titêa sekel tirita, dik lo taka bumna bûk hmanga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tangkaruaa mi rethei leia, mi tlachhamte chu pheikhawk bun khata leia, “Buhsî kan hralh theih nân,” titute u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Jakoba ropuina chhâlin chhia a chham a, “Matheilovin an hnathawh rêng rêng ka theihnghilh hauh lo vang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hemi avâng hian ram chu a khûrin a chhûnga awm apiangte chu an lungngai dâwn lo vem ni? A ni, Lui ang chuan a lo lian vek ang a; Aigupta ram lui angin a lo buaiin a kâm ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak chuan, “Chumi nîah chuan heti hi a ni ang a, chhûn laiah ni ka tlâktîr ang a, ni sat laiin lei chu ka tithim ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />In ruaiṭhehte chu lungngaihnaah leh in hla zawng zawngte chu ṭahnaah ka chantîr ang a; kâwng zawng zawng saiip puan ka ventîr ang a, lû tin chhîpah kawlhna ka rawn thlen ang; tin, fapa mal neih chhun tân lungngaihna ang leh, a tâwpna chu khâkna ni angin ka siam ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak chuan, “Ngai teh u, nite chu a lo thleng mêk a ni; chûng nîahte chuan ramah chuan ṭâm ka tîr ang a, chaw ṭâmna ni lovin, tui ṭâmna ni hek lovin, Lalpa thu hriatna ṭâmna zâwk chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, tuifinriat aṭangin tuifinriatah leh hmâr aṭangin chhakah pawh an vâkvai ang a; Lalpa thu chu zawng tûrin kil tinah an tlân ang a, an hmu lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan nula leh tlangvâl ṭhalaite meuh pawh tuihâlin an thidang ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Samari pathian lim chhâla chhechhama, ‘Dan pathian hmingin,’ titu emaw, ‘Beersheba pathian hmingin,’ titu emaw pawh chu an tlu ang a, an tho leh tawh lo vang.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maichâm bula dingin Lalpa chu ka hmu a; tin, anin, “Kawngka bulte a nghîn theih nân a chhîp bâwkte chu vua la, a vaia lu chungah tikeh sawm vek rawh. Tin, a thi bângte chu khandaihin ka that ang a; pakhat mah an tlân bo lo vang a, pakhat mahin an pumpelh hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mitthi khaw thlengin lai tlang mah sela, chuta ta chu ka kutin ka la chhuak ang; vânah lâwn mah sela, chuta ta chu ka hnûk thla ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Karmel tlâng chhîpah biru mah sela, ka zawng ang a, chuta ta chu anmahni ka la thla ang; tin, tuifinriat mawngah ka mit hmuh lohvah biru mah sela, chuta awm rûl chu thu ka pe ang a, anmahni a chu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An hmêlmaten sala an hruai chu thu ka pe ang a, khandaihin an sât hlum ang, ṭanpui ahnêkin anniho tihhlum hi ka tum a ni.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ram chu tawka, titui raltu chu Lalpa , Sipaihote Pathian chu a ni si a; tin, chuta awm zawng zawngte chu an lungngai ang; tin, Lui angin a lo lian ang a, Aigupta Lui angin a lo kâm leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vâna a pindante siama, lei chunga a pindan kual siama, tuifinriat tuite kova, lei chunga leih bawtu, a hming chu Lalpa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa thuchhuak chuan, “Aw Israel fate u, ka lakah Ethiopia fate ang tho in ni lo vem ni? Aigupta ram ata Israel leh, Kaptor ram ata Philistia mite leh, Kir ram ata Suria mite ka hruai chhuak lo vem ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa thuchhuak chuan, “Ngai teh u, Lalpa Pathian mit chu ram sual chungah a fu a; tin, lei chung ata ka tibo vang a; amaherawhchu, Jakoba chhûngte chu ka tichhe vek lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Ngai teh u, thu ka pe dâwn si a; tin, chhihrîa buh an hrî angin, Israela chhûngte chu hnam zawng zawng zîngah ka hrî ang a; nimahsela, fang tê ber pawh lei chungah a tla lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka mite zînga mi sual zawng zawng, ‘Chhiatna chuan min ûm phâk lo vang a, min hmachhawn hek lo vang,’ titute chu khandaihin an thi ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hêng thil titu Lalpa thuchhuak chuan heti hian a ti: “Chumi nîah chuan Davida bâwkte chim chu ka tungding ang a, a pawpte chu ka thawm ang a, a chhiate chu ka rem chho vang a, hmânlaia a awm ang khân ka sa ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Edom hmuna la awmte leh ka hminga koh hnam zawng zawngte chu an neih theih nân,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa thuchhuak chuan, “Ngai teh u, nite chu a lo thleng mêk a ni; chûng nîahte chuan lei lettu leh buh âttu leh grêp chîltu chuan chi thehtu chu a ûm phâk ang a; tin, tlâng sâng chuan uain thlum a fartîr ang a, tlâng zawng zawng an tui ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, ka mi Israel-te chu sal ata ka hruai kîr leh ang a, khaw ramte chu an siam leh ang a, an luah ang; tin, grêp huante an siam ang a, a uain chu an in ang; huante pawh an siam ang a, a rah chu an ei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, an ramah anmahni ka phun ang a, an hnêna ka pêk an ram ata chu pawh chhuahin an awm leh tawh lo vang,” Lalpa i Pathian chuan a ti.
  </para>
</usx>
